    <statement><p>The largest set on which the function <m>f(x,y) = 1/(8 - x^2 - y^2)</m>
is continuous is <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><ol label="A.">
<li>
<p>All of the xy-plane</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>All of the xy-plane except the circle <m>x^2 + y^2 = 8</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The interior of the circle <m>x^2 + y^2 = 8</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The interior of the circle <m>x^2 + y^2 = 8</m>, plus the circle</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The exterior of the circle <m>x^2 + y^2 = 8</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>B</p>
    </answer>
